<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">ask</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">ask</ansi> command lets you ask an NPC about a
specific topic, or give a command to a hired companion.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">ask</ansi> <ansi fg="cyan"><npc></ansi> <ansi fg="yellow"><topic></ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Examples: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">ask saris about the chrysalis</ansi>
  <ansi fg="command">ask saris what is the fold?</ansi>
  <ansi fg="command">ask buddy to drop sword</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">See Also: </ansi>
  <ansi fg="command">help talk</ansi>

You can sometimes overhear townspeople chatting with each other -- pause
in busy rooms to catch the gossip.

